      <definition>adj. Grey (of hair).</definition>
      <page>442</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠤᠭᠤᠷᠠᠯ ᠮᠣᠷᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>n. A roan horse.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠤᠭᠤᠷᠠᠯ ᠬᠠᠯᠢᠭᠤᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>Roan (horse) with dark mane and tail.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
